01:03:41,052 --> 01:03:47,052
We're the Millers is a 2013 road black comedy film directed by Rawson Marshall Thurber and starring Jennifer Aniston,
Jason Sudeikis, Emma Roberts, Will Poulter, Nick Offerman, Kathryn Hahn, Molly Quinn, and Ed Helms.

12
01:09:28,421 --> 01:09:34,421
The film's screenplay was written by Bob Fisher, Steve Faber, Sean
Anders, and John Morris, based on a story by Fisher and Faber.

13
01:15:15,789 --> 01:15:21,789
The plot follows a small-time pot dealer (Sudeikis) who convinces his neighbors to help him by
pretending to be his family in order to smuggle drugs from Mexico into the United States.

14
01:21:03,157 --> 01:21:09,157
The film premiered at the Traverse City Film Festival on August 3,
2013 and was released on August 7, 2013, by Warner Bros.

15
01:26:50,526 --> 01:26:56,526
Despite mixed reviews, it was a box office success, grossing $270 million
worldwide against a $37 million budget during its theatrical run.

16
01:32:37,894 --> 01:32:43,894
It was nominated for four People's Choice Awards, and
six MTV Movie Awards, winning two.

17
01:38:25,263 --> 01:38:31,263
The film explores themes of drug dealer, mexico,
drug smuggling, fireworks, camping.

18
